OL,3,GNEWSAElectrical fire on train leads to
OL,4,Arail disruption
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn electrical fire on a train has
OL,7,Fresulted in delays and cancellations on
OL,8,Fthe rail network between Penzance and
OL,9,FPlymouth.
OL,11,FNational Rail said the line between
OL,12,FLiskeard and Par was blocked due to a
OL,13,Fbroken-down train and servcies between
OL,14,FPlymouth and Penzance "would be
OL,15,Fcancelled in full, revised to start and
OL,16,Fterminate from alternative stations or
OL,17,Fbe delayed". Disruption was expected
OL,18,Funtil 13:00 GMT.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,345,340,200,160,0,100
