OL,3,GNEWSAElectrical fire on train leads to
OL,4,Arail disruption
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Great Western Railway (GWR)
OL,7,Fspokesperson said fire services
OL,8,Fresponded to a small electrical fire on
OL,9,Fthe Night Riviera Sleeper service on
OL,10,FFriday morning.
OL,12,F"The incident was quickly dealt with,
OL,13,Fand customers were moved to another
OL,14,Fpart of the train as a precaution to
OL,15,Favoid smoke," it said.
